Ported or adapted from OpenKH (see crates/kh2-formats):
  - OpenKh.Egs/Hed.cs, EgsHdAsset.cs, EgsEncryption.cs -> crates/kh2-formats/src/egs.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/Bar.cs                                  -> crates/kh2-formats/src/bar.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/Battle/*.cs, BaseTable.cs               -> crates/kh2-formats/src/battle.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/MotionTrigger.cs, Motion.cs, ModelCollision.cs, ObjectCollision.cs
                                                       -> crates/kh2-formats/src/motion.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/SystemData/Pref/*.cs                    -> crates/kh2-formats/src/pref.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/Pax.cs, Dpx.cs, Dpd.cs, Dpd.ParticleData.cs, DpdPData.cs
                                                       -> crates/kh2-formats/src/pax.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/Dpd*.cs, DpdPData.cs (program names), DpdModel.cs, DpdVsf.cs
                                                       -> crates/kh2-formats/src/dpd.rs
  - OpenKh.Kh2/Dpx.cs (effect record layout)           -> crates/kh2-fx/src/library.rs
    (crates/kh2-fx plays effects read with the readers above)
  - OpenKh.Command.Bdxio/Models/BdxTraps.cs (trap table),
    BdxInstructionDescs.cs (mnemonics)                 -> crates/kh2-bdx/src/traps.rs,
                                                          crates/kh2-bdx/src/disasm.rs
Changes: rewritten in Rust; cipher rounds folded into one XOR mask; the
cipher's substitution table is located in the user's own executable at
runtime instead of being embedded.

crates/kh1-hook/src/win/gummi.rs and chests.rs port logic from KH-1FM-AP-LUA
(https://github.com/gaithern/KH-1FM-AP-LUA): the "Instant Gummi" script by
denhonator with edits from Gicu, and the interaction script by KSX and Gicu.
